  "description": "A pure C# implementation of the Unicode Line Breaking Algorithm (UAX #14) for .NET 10. Determines break opportunities and mandatory break positions in Unicode text, conforming to Unicode 17.0.0 and UAX #14 Revision 55. The whole algorithm runs without a managed allocation and the library is annotated for Native AOT. Correctness is verified against the official LineBreakTest.txt of Unicode 17.0.0.",
